When the Wind Blows is a 1986 British apocalyptic adult animated film directed by
Jimmy Murakami based on the 1982 graphic novel by Raymond Briggs.

11
01:01:36,000 --> 01:01:42,000
It stars the voices of John Mills and Peggy Ashcroft as the two
main characters and was scored by Roger Waters.

12
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:18,000
The film recounts an elderly couple's attempt to survive a nuclear attack and
maintain a sense of normality in fallout and nuclear winter.

13
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
The film explores themes of husband wife relationship,
countryside, nuclear war, england, world war ii.

14
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:30,000
